#: random.cpp:41
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Usage: %1 [-setup] [args]\n"
"Starts a random screen saver.\n"
"Any arguments (except -setup) are passed on to the screen saver."
msgstr ""
"उपयोग: %1 %1 [-setup] [args]\n"
"अनियमित स्क्रिनसेभर सुरु गर्नुहोस् ।\n"
"स्क्रिनसेभरमा पास गरेको (सेटअप -बाहेक) को कुनै तर्कहरू ।"

